SetupBodyScalarsTest
├── when the wait is zero
│   └── it should read a wait of zero
├── when the wait is the widest uint48
│   └── it should read the widest uint48
├── when ignoresPause is true
│   └── it should read true
├── when ignoresPause is false
│   └── it should read false
└── when the body has no clauses
    └── it should still read both scalars
